    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "checkpointer 写合并补丁实测 TPS 提升三成",
      "summary": "Melanie Plageman 发出 checkpointer 写合并补丁的 v15。新增能力是普通后端和 background writer 写盘时，会在共享缓冲区里找目标块前后相邻的脏块，把写 IO 合并到 io_combine_limit 大小。在 IOPS 受限的环境下测试，pgbench scale 500、8 个客户端、上限 7500 IOPS，TPS 提升约三成，p99 延迟下降约七成半。这一版还补了 TAP 测试。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CAAKRu_ZoKTpnmQ3MmmQXTpG7msHrP3jNWC68sf8R82-8cgb7Kw@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Melanie Plageman",
      "source": "pgsql-hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-06-19",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "性能",
        "检查点",
        "IO"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "分区键选得不好会把写入全挤到一个分区",
      "summary": "分区键设计不当，写入会全挤在一个分区上，其余分区几乎闲着。文章梳理了随之而来的连锁反应：B-tree 索引频繁更新、页面分裂加剧、WAL 生成量上升，autovacuum 在热点分区上持续满负荷。文中给出基于 pg_stat_user_tables 的诊断查询，用死元组比例和索引大小定位问题分区。两条出路是改成按时间的 RANGE 分区让写入自然分散，或改用 hypertable 并对旧数据启用列存压缩。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/why-postgresql-partition-key-creating-write-bottleneck",
      "author": "TigerData",
      "source": "TigerData 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-19",
      "image": "https://blog-cms.tigerdata.com/blog/content/images/2026/06/how-single-column-choice-turns-database-write-bottleneck.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "分区",
        "写入",
        "调优"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Actions 收紧 pull_request_target 默认值",
      "summary": "GitHub 调整了 Actions 里 pull_request_target 触发时检出代码的默认行为。这个触发器带着仓库写权限运行，一旦顺手检出外部 PR 的代码，发布令牌、包仓库凭据和云密钥就可能落到外部贡献者手里，是经典的配置陷阱，平台改默认值比逐个项目打补丁影响面大得多。用到 pull_request_target、workflow_run 或自托管 runner 的仓库仍应自查。",
      "url": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-06-18-safer-pull_request_target-defaults-for-github-actions-checkout/",
      "author": "GitHub",
      "source": "GitHub Changelog",
      "source_date": "2026-06-18",
      "image": "https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/SaferPullRequestTargetDefaults_NewRelease_Unfurl_TextOnly.jpg",
      "domain": "infra",
      "tags": [
        "CI",
        "供应链",
        "安全"
      ],
      "position": 4
